        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Sollathaan Ninaikkiren, Sundara Swapnagalu, Ramana, Panchathanthiram\n- People: K. Balachander, Kamal Haasan, Sivakumar, S. V. Subbaiah, Jayachitra, Srividya, Shubha, Jayasudha, Yugi Sethu, Vijaykanth, A. R. Murugadoss, K. S. Ravikumar\n- Topics: Tamil cinema, film remakes\n\nFacts:\n- Kamal Haasan was born on 7 November 1954.\n- Kamal Haasan is an Indian film actor, director, screenwriter, producer, playback singer, and lyricist who works primarily in Tamil cinema.\n- Sollathaan Ninaikkiren is a 1973 Tamil-language film scripted and directed by K. Balachander.\n- Sollathaan Ninaikkiren stars Sivakumar, S. V. Subbaiah, Jayachitra, Srividya, Shubha, Kamal Haasan, and Jayasudha in the lead roles.\n- Sundara Swapnagalu is a remake of director K. Balachander's own Tamil film Sollathaan Ninaikkiren.\n- Yugi Sethu played notable roles in the Tamil films Ramana, directed by A. R. Murugadoss and featuring Vijaykanth, and Panchathanthiram, directed by K. S. Ravikumar and featuring Kamal Haasan.",
